{"id":432,"title":"选择排序、冒泡排序和插入排序","summary":"系统介绍排序算法，例如选择排序、冒泡排序和插入排序","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4b3c6647-8996-40e0-8734-38d48ffc0e8d","text":"## 什么是排序？\n\n排序是**系统地排列**数据的过程。在计算机科学中，排序算法将列表的元素按特定顺序排列。\n\n最常用排序是根据数字大小和字母顺序进行排序。排序对于优化其他算法的非常高效，这些算法经常依赖有顺的数据，才能将效率提升极致。\n\n### 正式定义\n\n假设存在一个列表`A` 或数组`A`，则：\n\n**升序**排序:\n- 对于任意 $\\forall$ $i$ ，满足$i \\leq n-1$ 且 $A[i]\\leq A[i+1]$\n\n**降序**排序:\n- 对于任意 $\\forall$ $i$ ，满足$i \\leq n-1$ 且 $A[i]\\geq A[i+1]$\n\n\n## 排序算法\n\n现在，讨论几个常见的排序算法:","text_html":"<h2>什么是排序？</h2>\n<p>排序是<strong>系统地排列</strong>数据的过程。在计算机科学中，排序算法将列表的元素按特定顺序排列。</p>\n<p>最常用排序是根据数字大小和字母顺序进行排序。排序对于优化其他算法的非常高效，这些算法经常依赖有顺的数据，才能将效率提升极致。</p>\n<h3>正式定义</h3>\n<p>假设存在一个列表<code>A</code> 或数组<code>A</code>，则：</p>\n<p><strong>升序</strong>排序:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对于任意 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">∀</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.65952em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.65952em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span></span></span></span> ，满足<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i \\leq n-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.65952em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.79549em;vertical-align:-0.13597em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A[i]\\leq A[i+1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>降序</strong>排序:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对于任意 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.69444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">∀</span></span></span></span> <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.65952em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.65952em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span></span></span></span> ，满足<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i \\leq n-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.65952em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.79549em;vertical-align:-0.13597em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A[i]\\geq A[i+1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>排序算法</h2>\n<p>现在，讨论几个常见的排序算法:</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"9ac09ed6-1bd9-4b69-81eb-787e331f1d9a","text":"### 选择排序","text_html":"<h3>选择排序</h3>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":1},{"type":"Columns","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8466325c-934a-4503-af3b-d20fe4f04b5d","comps":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"colum_0_8466325c-934a-4503-af3b-d20fe4f04b5d","text":"该算法的原理是反复寻找列表中的**最小元素**，并将其置于开头。这样一来，该算法就维护了两个列表:\n\n1. **已经排序**的元素的子列表，从左到右填充\n\n2. **待排序**的剩余元素的子列表\n\n换句话说，选择排序（Selection sort）是一种简单直观的排序算法。它的工作原理是：第一次从待排序的数据元素中选出最小（或最大）的一个元素，存放在序列的起始位置，然后再从剩余的未排序元素中寻找到最小（大）元素，然后放到已排序的序列的末尾。以此类推，直到全部待排序的数据元素的个数为零\n\n插图演示了该算法的核心思想。\n\n完整的代码如下：","text_html":"<p>该算法的原理是反复寻找列表中的<strong>最小元素</strong>，并将其置于开头。这样一来，该算法就维护了两个列表:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>已经排序</strong>的元素的子列表，从左到右填充</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>待排序</strong>的剩余元素的子列表</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>换句话说，选择排序（Selection sort）是一种简单直观的排序算法。它的工作原理是：第一次从待排序的数据元素中选出最小（或最大）的一个元素，存放在序列的起始位置，然后再从剩余的未排序元素中寻找到最小（大）元素，然后放到已排序的序列的末尾。以此类推，直到全部待排序的数据元素的个数为零</p>\n<p>插图演示了该算法的核心思想。</p>\n<p>完整的代码如下：</p>\n"},"width":80},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"colum_1_8466325c-934a-4503-af3b-d20fe4f04b5d","text":"![](/content/assets/87f9fe8d10351cf765af.gif)\n","text_html":"<p><img src=\"/content/assets/87f9fe8d10351cf765af.gif\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n"},"width":20}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"2eba0200-64fd-400b-aa47-2846e25cebb0","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_2eba0200-64fd-400b-aa47-2846e25cebb0","title":"selection_sort","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def selection_sort(lst):\n    \"\"\"\n    Selection sort function\n    :param lst: List of integers\n    \"\"\"\n\n    # Traverse through all lst elements\n    for i in range(len(lst)):\n        # Find the minimum element in unsorted lst\n        min_index = i\n        for j in range(i + 1, len(lst)):\n            if lst[min_index] > lst[j]:\n                min_index = j\n\n        # Swap the found minimum element with the first element\n        lst[i], lst[min_index] = lst[min_index], lst[i]\n\n\n# Driver code to test above\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n\n    lst = [3, 2, 1, 5, 4]\n    selection_sort(lst)  # Calling selection sort function\n\n    # Printing Sorted lst\n    print(\"Sorted lst: \", lst)\n    ","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"72e0de8b-3287-4a67-a8f1-ce4ae179fb05","text":"#### 时间复杂度\n\n上述代码的时间复杂度为$O(n^2)$，因为每次寻找列表中的最小元素需要对整个列表中的每个元素进行迭代。但是二次方的时间复杂度对于较大的列表是不切实际，且巨慢的！","text_html":"<h4>时间复杂度</h4>\n<p>上述代码的时间复杂度为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141079999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.064108em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，因为每次寻找列表中的最小元素需要对整个列表中的每个元素进行迭代。但是二次方的时间复杂度对于较大的列表是不切实际，且巨慢的！</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":4},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"dec5b4ec-a751-4508-91bd-65f40bc01291","text":"### 泡沫排序","text_html":"<h3>泡沫排序</h3>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":5},{"type":"Columns","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"db6b04c8-c61e-43bf-b561-3cad9f460f42","comps":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"colum_0_db6b04c8-c61e-43bf-b561-3cad9f460f42","text":"\n这是另一种著名的排序法，也称为\"沉降排序\"。它的工作原理是**比较相邻**的几对元素，如果它们的顺序不对，就交换。这样反复进行，直到列表被排序。\n\n直观思考：一个气泡经过列表，\"抓住\" 最大/最小元素，并将其带到右边。\n\n插图演示了该算法的核心思想。\n\n完整代码如下：","text_html":"<p>这是另一种著名的排序法，也称为&quot;沉降排序&quot;。它的工作原理是<strong>比较相邻</strong>的几对元素，如果它们的顺序不对，就交换。这样反复进行，直到列表被排序。</p>\n<p>直观思考：一个气泡经过列表，“抓住” 最大/最小元素，并将其带到右边。</p>\n<p>插图演示了该算法的核心思想。</p>\n<p>完整代码如下：</p>\n"},"width":60},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"colum_1_db6b04c8-c61e-43bf-b561-3cad9f460f42","text":"![](/content/assets/dbd7a2cdcea73fe8fc7b.gif)\n","text_html":"<p><img src=\"/content/assets/dbd7a2cdcea73fe8fc7b.gif\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n"},"width":40}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":6},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"816bd85e-ea3a-48ea-a4b1-bd6b0c9c07e4","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_816bd85e-ea3a-48ea-a4b1-bd6b0c9c07e4","title":"bubble_sort","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def bubble_sort(lst):\n    \"\"\"\n    Bubble sort function\n    :param lst: lst of unsorted integers\n    \"\"\"\n\n    # Traverse through all list elements\n    for i in range(len(lst)):\n\n        # Last i elements are already in place\n        for j in range(0, len(lst) - i - 1):\n\n            # Traverse the list from 0 to size of lst - i - 1\n            # Swap if the element found is greater than the next element\n            if lst[j] > lst[j + 1]:\n                lst[j], lst[j + 1] = lst[j + 1], lst[j]\n\n\n# Driver code to test above\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n\n    lst = [3, 2, 1, 5, 4]\n    bubble_sort(lst)  # Calling bubble sort function\n\n    print(\"Sorted list is: \", lst)\n    ","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":7},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"bba20d52-d22a-4a24-83a9-bf591d6cd426","text":"#### 时间复杂读\n\n代码的时间复杂度是$O(n^2)$。同样，这种算法的效率也不高。","text_html":"<h4>时间复杂读</h4>\n<p>代码的时间复杂度是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141079999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.064108em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。同样，这种算法的效率也不高。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":8},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"520a5566-b6bf-4f41-8fc0-82910eeaf32b","text":"### 插入排序","text_html":"<h3>插入排序</h3>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":9},{"type":"Columns","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f7b28cf0-fadf-4e6c-b554-b8f46e513887","comps":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"colum_0_f7b28cf0-fadf-4e6c-b554-b8f46e513887","text":"**插入排序**是另一种著名的排序算法，其工作方式与你在现实生活中的排序一样。（想下你是如何让纸牌变的有序的？）\n\n它遍历给定的列表，找出每个元素的正确位置，并将其插入那里。","text_html":"<p><strong>插入排序</strong>是另一种著名的排序算法，其工作方式与你在现实生活中的排序一样。（想下你是如何让纸牌变的有序的？）</p>\n<p>它遍历给定的列表，找出每个元素的正确位置，并将其插入那里。</p>\n"},"width":60},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"colum_1_f7b28cf0-fadf-4e6c-b554-b8f46e513887","text":"![]( /content/assets/a4687439347986ee5adc.gif)\n","text_html":"<p><img src=\"/content/assets/a4687439347986ee5adc.gif\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n"},"width":40}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":10},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f550e68a-8f8b-4ef8-bafb-7bf6936260f4","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_f550e68a-8f8b-4ef8-bafb-7bf6936260f4","title":"insertion_sort","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def insertion_sort(lst):\n    \"\"\"\n    Insertion sort function\n    :param lst: lst of unsorted integers\n    \"\"\"\n\n    # Traverse through 1 to len(lst)\n    for i in range(1, len(lst)):\n\n        key = lst[i]\n\n        # Move elements of lst greater than key, to one position ahead\n        j = i - 1\n        while j >= 0 and key < lst[j]:\n            lst[j + 1] = lst[j]\n            j -= 1\n        lst[j + 1] = key\n\n\n# Driver code to test above\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n\n    lst = [3, 2, 1, 5, 4]\n    insertion_sort(lst)  # Calling insertion sort function\n\n    print(\"Sorted list is: \", lst)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":11},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7e313479-5066-43f3-8210-253fd0b17e7d","text":"#### 时间复杂度\n\n该算法的复杂度为$O(n^2)$，这也使得对于大的输入规模来说是一个糟糕的选择。然而，请注意，只有当输入列表被反向排序时，其复杂度才是$n^2$。因此，\"最佳情况\"下的复杂度（当列表以正确的顺序排序时）是$\\Omega(n)$。\n\n## 空间复杂度\n\n请注意，上面这些算法都是就地取材，没有消耗额外空间，因此空间复杂度为$O(1)$。\n\n---\n\n下一课中，我们将深入了解一种更复杂、但渐进性更好的排序算法--归并排序。","text_html":"<h4>时间复杂度</h4>\n<p>该算法的复杂度为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141079999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.064108em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，这也使得对于大的输入规模来说是一个糟糕的选择。然而，请注意，只有当输入列表被反向排序时，其复杂度才是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141079999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8141079999999999em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span></span></span></span>。因此，&quot;最佳情况&quot;下的复杂度（当列表以正确的顺序排序时）是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Ω</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2>空间复杂度</h2>\n<p>请注意，上面这些算法都是就地取材，没有消耗额外空间，因此空间复杂度为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>下一课中，我们将深入了解一种更复杂、但渐进性更好的排序算法–归并排序。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":12}],"status":"undo","course_no":"010","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/010/page/432"}
